{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LMpPjLCs92WBbvvbKtGcxw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: Phase gradient核心发现稳健，但strategy specificity强度和机制覆盖度需要显著限定。LLaMA\n2\t  n=250不会改变n=50的定性结论——imp_vs_rand交互仍为small effect，仅s030 Bonferroni显著。GPQA Diamond作为new\n3\t  benchmark，strategy specificity ratio预期衰减至2-4×（远低于MATH-500的15×）。论文Claims需三处调整：Title/Abstract软化、C8改写为partial\n4\t  support、Mechanism §降级。\n5\timagined_experiments:\n6\t- name: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n7\t  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n8\t  description: LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (importance/random\n9\t    × s015/s020/s025/s030), MATH-500\n10\t  expected_results:\n11\t    n_problems: 250\n12\t    n_valid: 245\n13\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n14\t      s015: 0.98\n15\t      s020: 1.05\n16\t      s025: 1.08\n17\t      s030: 0.97\n18\t    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n19\t    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n20\t      s015: 0.33\n21\t      s020: 0.37\n22\t      s025: 0.42\n23\t      s030: 0.44\n24\t    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_small_but_significant\n25\t    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n26\t      s015: 0.18\n27\t      s020: 0.24\n28\t      s025: 0.28\n29\t      s030: 0.33\n30\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n31\t    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n32\t      s015: 0.34\n33\t      s020: 0.12\n34\t      s025: 0.065\n35\t      s030: 0.018\n36\t    significant_bonferroni:\n37\t      s015: false\n38\t      s020: false\n39\t      s025: false\n40\t      s030: true\n41\t    median_diff:\n42\t      s015: 0.019\n43\t      s020: 0.024\n44\t      s025: 0.088\n45\t      s030: 0.31\n46\t    median_diff_ci:\n47\t      s015:\n48\t      - 0.005\n49\t      - 0.035\n50\t      s020:\n51\t      - -0.02\n52\t      - 0.08\n53\t      s025:\n54\t      - 0.01\n55\t      - 0.21\n56\t      s030:\n57\t      - 0.05\n58\t      - 0.48\n59\t    random_phase_gradient_ci_excludes_zero:\n60\t      s015: true\n61\t      s020: true\n62\t      s025: true\n63\t      s030: true\n64\t  result_rationale: 'n=50→n=250 功效提升（~2.2× SE缩减）不足以将 small effect (d_z≈0.3) 推过 Bonferroni\n65\t    门槛 （需 d_z>0.4 在 n=250 时达显著）。s030 的 d_z=0.33 刚好在边缘——n=250 将其 p 值从 0.029 压至 ~0.018，仍然显著。s025\n66\t    (d_z≈0.28) 在 n=250 时 uncorrected p≈0.016 但 Bonferroni×4 后 p≈0.065 仍不显著。关键：这不是\n67\t    power 问题——效应本身就小，LLaMA 架构上 strategy×phase 交互 弱是 true effect。Random phase gradient\n68\t    (d_z 0.33-0.44) CIs 将全部排除零（n=250 时 d_z>0.2 即可），确认 LLaMA 上 random 也有 non-trivial\n69\t    phase gradient——这是与 DeepSeek/Qwen 的关键架构差异。整体结论：within-importance phase gradient\n70\t    强且稳健(d_z~1.0)， imp_vs_rand 交互弱但方向正确(monotonic increasing)，定性结论与 n=50 完全一致。\n71\t\n72\t    '\n73\t  tables:\n74\t  - name: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 comparison'\n75\t    columns:\n76\t    - metric\n77\t    - n=50_value\n78\t    - n=250_predicted\n79\t    - change\n80\t    rows:\n81\t    - - imp_vs_rand_dz_s030\n82\t      - '0.3352'\n83\t      - '0.33'\n84\t      - stable (CI narrower)\n85\t    - - Bonferroni_sig_count\n86\t      - 1/4\n87\t      - 1/4\n88\t      - no change\n89\t    - - random_phase_dz_mean\n90\t      - '0.40'\n91\t      - '0.39'\n92\t      - stable\n93\t    - - importance_phase_dz_mean\n94\t      - '1.06'\n95\t      - '1.02'\n96\t      - stable\n97\t  figures_description:\n98\t  - 'Fig: Forest plot showing imp_vs_rand d_z with 95% CI for s015-s030, n=50 vs n=250\n99\t    overlay. Both show same pattern—CIs narrow but effect remains small.'\n100\t  - 'Fig: Phase gradient d_z comparison (importance vs random) across 4 sparsity levels,\n101\t    demonstrating LLaMA''s unique pattern where random also shows significant gradient.'\n102\t  analysis: 'n=250 确认 C8 partially_confirmed 不变。论文写法：''At n=250, LLaMA replicates\n103\t    the within-importance phase gradient (d_z≈1.0, all levels p<0.001) but the strategy×phase\n104\t    interaction remains small (d_z 0.18-0.33) with only s030 reaching Bonferroni significance\n105\t    (p=0.018). Critically, random masking on LLaMA shows a non-trivial phase gradient\n106\t    (d_z 0.33-0.44, all CIs exclude zero), suggesting strategy-dependence of compound\n107\t    severity is architecture-modulated.'' 这是 median 档核心论点：phase gradient universal，\n108\t    strategy specificity architecture-dependent。\n109\t\n110\t    '\n111\t- name: c8_llama_gpu0_s025_preemptive\n112\t  plan_id: c8_llama_gpu0_s025\n113\t  description: LLaMA importance s025 单条件预加速（n=250），作为 c8_llama_n250_fixed 的一部分\n114\t  expected_results:\n115\t    n_problems: 250\n116\t    n_valid: 245\n117\t    importance_s025_median_ii_low: 1.82\n118\t    importance_s025_median_ii_high: 0.085\n119\t    importance_s025_median_diff: 0.088\n120\t    importance_s025_phase_gradient_dz: 1.08\n121\t    importance_s025_phase_gradient_ci:\n122\t    - 0.82\n123\t    - 1.38\n124\t    importance_s025_wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n125\t  result_rationale: '这是 c8_llama_n250_fixed 中的一个子条件。LLaMA importance s025 在 n=50 时\n126\t    phase gradient d_z=1.1227 (CI [0.87, 1.58])。n=250 时 CI 缩窄至 [0.82, 1.38]，中心估计稳定在~1.08。\n127\t    这是 within-importance 效应（不涉及 imp_vs_rand 比较），本身是 large effect，n=250 只是 增加精度。Median\n128\t    II 值与 n=50 的 median_diff=0.0947 基本一致（大样本回归到更稳定估计）。\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  tables: []\n132\t  figures_description: []\n133\t  analysis: 预期完全符合 n=50 结论，仅 CI 缩窄。不改变任何 claim。\n134\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n135\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n136\t  description: GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DeepSeek-R1 × importance × s015, quantile三分相位\n137\t  expected_results:\n138\t    n_problems: 198\n139\t    n_valid: 185\n140\t    mid_null_rate: 0.15\n141\t    importance_s015_median_ii_low: 0.28\n142\t    importance_s015_median_ii_mid: 0.09\n143\t    importance_s015_median_ii_high: 0.018\n144\t    importance_s015_median_diff: 0.24\n145\t    importance_s015_ci:\n146\t    - 0.12\n147\t    - 0.42\n148\t    importance_s015_wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n149\t    phase_gradient_dz: 0.52\n150\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n151\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond 是非数学推理任务（科学 QA），推理链比 MATH-500 短~40%，phase 结构不如数学\n152\t    清晰。s015 是最低 sparsity——在 MATH-500 上 DS imp s015 median_diff=0.39，但 GPQA 推理链 更短意味着\n153\t    low-sparsity phase 的 token 数更少、II 累积效应弱化。预期 median_diff ~0.24 （约为 MATH-500 的 60%），但仍显著（n=198\n154\t    提供充足功效）。Phase gradient monotonic 但 magnitude 衰减：与 GSM8K 模式一致——更简单/更短的推理链 → phase\n155\t    modulation 效应变弱。 这支持 median 档的 cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count:\n156\t    2-3 预测。\n157\t\n158\t    '\n159\t  tables:\n160\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-benchmark s015 comparison'\n161\t    columns:\n162\t    - benchmark\n163\t    - DS_imp_s015_median_diff\n164\t    - reasoning_chain_length\n165\t    rows:\n166\t    - - MATH-500\n167\t      - '0.39'\n168\t      - long (avg ~550 tokens)\n169\t    - - GSM8K\n170\t      - '0.241'\n171\t      - medium (avg ~300 tokens)\n172\t    - - GPQA Diamond\n173\t      - 0.24 (predicted)\n174\t      - medium-short (avg ~350 tokens)\n175\t  figures_description:\n176\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart comparing phase gradient magnitude at s015 across three benchmarks,\n177\t    showing consistent monotonic decrease with reasoning chain complexity.'\n178\t  analysis: 'GPQA s015 单条件预期 PASS——phase gradient 存在且显著。但 magnitude 低于 MATH-500， 与\n179\t    median 档预期一致。关键意义：证明 phase modulation 不限于数学推理，也存在于科学 QA， 但 specificity ratio 可能更低（需要完整\n180\t    random 对照才能计算）。\n181\t\n182\t    '\n183\t- name: gpqa_ds_full_pipeline\n184\t  plan_id: gpqa_diamond_full\n185\t  description: GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DS+QW × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(×2\n186\t    controls s025/s030) = 10 runs\n187\t  expected_results:\n188\t    ds_importance:\n189\t      s015:\n190\t        median_gradient: 0.24\n191\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n192\t      s020:\n193\t        median_gradient: 0.68\n194\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n195\t      s025:\n196\t        median_gradient: 1.85\n197\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n198\t      s030:\n199\t        median_gradient: 3.92\n200\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n201\t    qw_importance:\n202\t      s015:\n203\t        median_gradient: 0.04\n204\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n205\t      s020:\n206\t        median_gradient: 0.19\n207\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n208\t      s025:\n209\t        median_gradient: 0.72\n210\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n211\t      s030:\n212\t        median_gradient: 1.68\n213\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n214\t    ds_random:\n215\t      s025:\n216\t        median_gradient: 0.58\n217\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.03\n218\t      s030:\n219\t        median_gradient: 1.21\n220\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n221\t    qw_random:\n222\t      s025:\n223\t        median_gradient: 0.31\n224\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.06\n225\t      s030:\n226\t        median_gradient: 0.72\n227\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n228\t    imp_rand_ratio:\n229\t      ds_s025: 3.2\n230\t      ds_s030: 3.2\n231\t      qw_s025: 2.3\n232\t      qw_s030: 2.3\n233\t    dose_response_monotonic_ds: true\n234\t    dose_response_monotonic_qw: true\n235\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 2.3-3.2×\n236\t    cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n237\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心预测：strategy_specificity_ratio_new_benchmark = [2.0,\n238\t    4.9]。GPQA 作为 非数学推理 benchmark：(1) 推理链更短→ phase 区分度降低→ phase gradient magnitude\n239\t    约为 MATH-500 的 55-65%（类似 GSM8K 衰减模式）；(2) Random eviction 在 GPQA 上也会显示 更强的 phase\n240\t    gradient（因为任务推理结构不如数学严格，attention 模式更分散）， 导致 imp/rand ratio 从 MATH-500 的 15× 衰减至\n241\t    2-4×；(3) 两模型 importance gradient 均 monotonic（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count\n242\t    达到 3/3）——phase gradient 的 universality 是 median 档确认的核心结论；(4) QW imp s015 可能 borderline\n243\t    （p=0.02 uncorrected，Bonferroni 后 NS），与 QW onset threshold s≥0.20 一致。 DS random\n244\t    s025 预期 borderline 显著——GPQA 的 random 比 MATH-500 更容易显著，因为 任务本身 phase structure\n245\t    更弱→ random 和 importance 的差异缩小。\n246\t\n247\t    '\n248\t  tables:\n249\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy specificity ratio across benchmarks'\n250\t    columns:\n251\t    - benchmark\n252\t    - DS_ratio_s025\n253\t    - DS_ratio_s030\n254\t    - QW_ratio_s025\n255\t    - QW_ratio_s030\n256\t    rows:\n257\t    - - MATH-500 (n=500)\n258\t      - 15.5×\n259\t      - 16.6×\n260\t      - 2.7×\n261\t      - 3.5×\n262\t    - - GSM8K (n=50)\n263\t      - 3.8×\n264\t      - 2.8×\n265\t      - ~3×\n266\t      - ~2.5×\n267\t    - - GPQA Diamond (n=198, predicted)\n268\t      - 3.2×\n269\t      - 3.2×\n270\t      - 2.3×\n271\t      - 2.3×\n272\t  - name: 'Table: Dose-response comparison (DS importance median_gradient)'\n273\t    columns:\n274\t    - sparsity\n275\t    - MATH-500\n276\t    - GSM8K\n277\t    - GPQA (predicted)\n278\t    rows:\n279\t    - - s015\n280\t      - '0.39'\n281\t      - '0.241'\n282\t      - '0.24'\n283\t    - - s020\n284\t      - '1.21'\n285\t      - '0.740'\n286\t      - '0.68'\n287\t    - - s025\n288\t      - '3.99'\n289\t      - '1.992'\n290\t      - '1.85'\n291\t    - - s030\n292\t      - '8.48'\n293\t      - '4.682'\n294\t      - '3.92'\n295\t  figures_description:\n296\t  - 'Fig: Three-panel dose-response curves (MATH-500 / GSM8K / GPQA) showing parallel\n297\t    monotonic gradients with benchmark-dependent magnitude scaling.'\n298\t  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × sparsity × model) demonstrating\n299\t    systematic attenuation from MATH-500 (15×) → GSM8K (3×) → GPQA (3×).'\n300\t  analysis: 'GPQA 完整数据将强化 C10 的叙事方向：phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健（3/3 monotonic），\n301\t    但 strategy specificity 高度 task-dependent（15× → 3× → 3×）。论文 Discussion 需要 一段专门解释\n302\t    specificity 衰减的可能机制：更短的推理链 → phase boundary 更模糊 → random eviction 在\"错误\" phase\n303\t    的概率上升 → imp/rand 区分缩小。这是 median 档要求 的 \"softened language\" 之一：不能说 \"strategy specificity\n304\t    is a universal property\"， 必须限定为 \"strongest on complex mathematical reasoning with\n305\t    long CoT\"。\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t- name: qwen25_14b_math500\n309\t  plan_id: 14b_scale_extension\n310\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(s030)\n311\t    = 5 runs\n312\t  expected_results:\n313\t    n_problems: 50\n314\t    importance:\n315\t      s015:\n316\t        median_diff: 0.055\n317\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n318\t        cohens_d: 0.42\n319\t      s020:\n320\t        median_diff: 0.28\n321\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n322\t        cohens_d: 0.68\n323\t      s025:\n324\t        median_diff: 0.92\n325\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n326\t        cohens_d: 1.05\n327\t      s030:\n328\t        median_diff: 2.35\n329\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n330\t        cohens_d: 1.28\n331\t    random_s030:\n332\t      median_diff: 0.68\n333\t      wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n334\t      phase_gradient_dz: 0.38\n335\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 3.5\n336\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n337\t    dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n338\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n339\t      s015: 0.85\n340\t      s020: 0.92\n341\t      s025: 1.02\n342\t      s030: 0.95\n343\t    onset_threshold: s015 (similar to QW-7B)\n344\t  result_rationale: '14B 模型相对 7B 有更多 attention heads (40→40 for 14B GQA, 但 KV heads\n345\t    从 8→8)， 实际 GQA 结构意味着 head pruning 的冗余度不同。预期：(1) Phase gradient 依然 monotonic 且\n346\t    d_z~1.0（与 Qwen2-7B 一致，因为 phase modulation 是 reasoning structure 的属性， 不强依赖模型规模）；(2)\n347\t    Absolute magnitude 可能比 7B 略小（14B 更鲁棒，residual stream 容量更大）——median_diff ~2.35\n348\t    vs 7B 的 3.16 at s030；(3) Strategy specificity ratio ~3.5×（14B random 也更难产生大 gradient，因为冗余更多）；(4)\n349\t    Onset threshold 仍在 s015 （与 7B Qwen 一致，架构决定而非规模决定）。Median 档预期：这个实验不会 dramatically\n350\t    改变 故事，但为 Limitations 中的 \"7B only\" 提供部分回应。Cohen''s d 范围 0.42→1.28 落在 qw_cohens_d_range\n351\t    [0.37, 1.44] 内。\n352\t\n353\t    '\n354\t  tables:\n355\t  - name: 'Table: 14B vs 7B Qwen importance dose-response'\n356\t    columns:\n357\t    - sparsity\n358\t    - QW-7B_median_diff (n=500)\n359\t    - QW-14B_predicted (n=50)\n360\t    - ratio\n361\t    rows:\n362\t    - - s015\n363\t      - '0.066'\n364\t      - '0.055'\n365\t      - 0.83×\n366\t    - - s020\n367\t      - '0.307'\n368\t      - '0.28'\n369\t      - 0.91×\n370\t    - - s025\n371\t      - '1.075'\n372\t      - '0.92'\n373\t      - 0.86×\n374\t    - - s030\n375\t      - '3.155'\n376\t      - '2.35'\n377\t      - 0.74×\n378\t  figures_description:\n379\t  - 'Fig: Dual dose-response curve (7B vs 14B) with shared x-axis (sparsity) showing\n380\t    parallel scaling with 14B ~20-25% lower magnitude.'\n381\t  analysis: '14B 实验是 reviewer concern RC1 (7B only) 的直接回应。Median 档预期：定性完全复制 （monotonic,\n382\t    strategy×phase interaction），定量略弱（magnitude ~75-90% of 7B）。 论文加一句：\"Preliminary\n383\t    results on Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct (n=50) replicate the monotonic phase gradient\n384\t    (Spearman ρ=1.0, all d_z>0.8), suggesting the phenomenon is not scale-specific\n385\t    within the 7-14B range. Larger-scale validation remains future work.\" 这足够回应 reviewer\n386\t    而不需要 14B 的完整 n=500 replication。\n387\t\n388\t    '\n389\t- name: c10_lang_s020_s025_analysis\n390\t  plan_id: c10_lang_s020_s025\n391\t  description: MATH-500 language switching at s020/s025, 补全 dense→s015→s020→s025→s030\n392\t    全链\n393\t  expected_results:\n394\t    s020:\n395\t      switch_rate: 0.14\n396\t      cn_count: 7\n397\t      en_count: 43\n398\t      cn_acc: 0.33\n399\t      en_acc: 0.25\n400\t    s025:\n401\t      switch_rate: 0.32\n402\t      cn_count: 16\n403\t      en_count: 34\n404\t      cn_acc: 0.2\n405\t      en_acc: 0.057\n406\t    full_chain_switch_rate:\n407\t    - 0.0\n408\t    - 0.04\n409\t    - 0.14\n410\t    - 0.32\n411\t    - 0.4\n412\t    monotonic: true\n413\t    correlation_switch_vs_ii: 0.55\n414\t  result_rationale: '这个实验已经完成（registry 显示 success）。实际结果与 median 档吻合：language switching\n415\t    单调递增 (0%→4%→14%→32%→40%)，是 compound degradation 的 behavioral manifestation。 Switch\n416\t    rate 与 II 相关但不完美(r≈0.55)——因为 switching 是离散二元事件而 II 是连续量， 且 switching 受模型 tokenizer\n417\t    双语 capability 影响（architecture-specific confound）。 Median 档解读：这个数据支持论文的 Discussion\n418\t    段落（compound sparsity 不仅影响数值推理 能力，还影响 language coherence），但不能作为独立 claim——它是 severity\n419\t    的 symptom 而非 独立发现。\n420\t\n421\t    '\n422\t  tables:\n423\t  - name: 'Table: Language switching dose-response'\n424\t    columns:\n425\t    - sparsity\n426\t    - switch_rate\n427\t    - cn_acc\n428\t    - en_acc\n429\t    - overall_acc\n430\t    rows:\n431\t    - - dense\n432\t      - 0%\n433\t      - N/A\n434\t      - '0.52'\n435\t      - '0.52'\n436\t    - - s015\n437\t      - 4%\n438\t      - 0%\n439\t      - '0.375'\n440\t      - '0.36'\n441\t    - - s020\n442\t      - 14%\n443\t      - '0.33'\n444\t      - '0.25'\n445\t      - '0.26'\n446\t    - - s025\n447\t      - 32%\n448\t      - '0.20'\n449\t      - '0.057'\n450\t      - '0.10'\n451\t    - - s030\n452\t      - 40%\n453\t      - '0.10'\n454\t      - '0.10'\n455\t      - '0.10'\n456\t  figures_description:\n457\t  - 'Fig: Dual-axis plot—left axis: accuracy decline; right axis: Chinese switching\n458\t    rate. Both monotonic, showing compound sparsity triggers multilingual collapse.'\n459\t  analysis: 'Language switching 数据已完成，为 Appendix 提供额外 behavioral evidence。 不改变核心 claims。Median\n460\t    档下，这属于 ''nice-to-have supplementary evidence'' 而非 论文主线。§6 Discussion 加一段提及即可。\n461\t\n462\t    '\n463\t- name: gpqa_think_validation\n464\t  plan_id: gpqa_think_validation\n465\t  description: GPQA Diamond </think> phase segmentation validation (Run 2, supplementary)\n466\t  expected_results:\n467\t    n_problems: 198\n468\t    n_valid: 180\n469\t    median_kappa: 0.82\n470\t    thinking_in_low_sparsity_phase: 0.72\n471\t    answer_in_high_sparsity_phase: 0.58\n472\t    temporal_ordering: 0.51\n473\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA 的 </think> validation 预期 kappa 略低于 MATH-500 (0.88)——GPQA\n474\t    是多选题， 推理链结构更不规则（有些问题直接选答案，有些有长推理）。Kappa=0.82 仍在 ''substantial agreement'' 范围。thinking_in_low=0.72（低于\n475\t    MATH-500 的 0.82）因为 GPQA 推理链更短 导致 low-sparsity phase 混合了更多 transition 内容。Answer_in_high=0.58（低于\n476\t    MATH-500 的 0.66）因为 GPQA 答案部分通常只有一个字母选项，token 数极少，phase assignment 更不稳定。Temporal\n477\t    ordering 更低（0.51 vs 0.58）因为 GPQA 非线性推理 较多（排除法、回溯等）。这些都是 median 档预期——kappa 仍然 acceptable\n478\t    但 phase alignment 指标比数学弱。\n479\t\n480\t    '\n481\t  tables: []\n482\t  figures_description:\n483\t  - 'Fig: Appendix figure showing kappa distribution across GPQA problems (histogram)\n484\t    vs MATH-500 overlay.'\n485\t  analysis: Supplementary validation，放 Appendix。如果 kappa<0.75 则需要承认 quantile  segmentation\n486\t    在 GPQA 上不如 MATH-500 可靠——但 0.82 仍然足够支持主结论。 不影响论文主线 claims。\n487\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da179c64-682b-4476-8ead-731d6820bfd5","uuid":"73c9666b-3769-462f-bf65-37a9876f4d94","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:13:41.564Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: Phase gradient核心发现稳健，但strategy specificity强度和机制覆盖度需要显著限定。LLaMA\n  n=250不会改变n=50的定性结论——imp_vs_rand交互仍为small effect，仅s030 Bonferroni显著。GPQA Diamond作为new\n  benchmark，strategy specificity ratio预期衰减至2-4×（远低于MATH-500的15×）。论文Claims需三处调整：Title/Abstract软化、C8改写为partial\n  support、Mechanism §降级。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n  description: LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (importance/random\n    × s015/s020/s025/s030), MATH-500\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 250\n    n_valid: 245\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n      s015: 0.98\n      s020: 1.05\n      s025: 1.08\n      s030: 0.97\n    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n      s015: 0.33\n      s020: 0.37\n      s025: 0.42\n      s030: 0.44\n    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_small_but_significant\n    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n      s015: 0.18\n      s020: 0.24\n      s025: 0.28\n      s030: 0.33\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n      s015: 0.34\n      s020: 0.12\n      s025: 0.065\n      s030: 0.018\n    significant_bonferroni:\n      s015: false\n      s020: false\n      s025: false\n      s030: true\n    median_diff:\n      s015: 0.019\n      s020: 0.024\n      s025: 0.088\n      s030: 0.31\n    median_diff_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.005\n      - 0.035\n      s020:\n      - -0.02\n      - 0.08\n      s025:\n      - 0.01\n      - 0.21\n      s030:\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.48\n    random_phase_gradient_ci_excludes_zero:\n      s015: true\n      s020: true\n      s025: true\n      s030: true\n  result_rationale: 'n=50→n=250 功效提升（~2.2× SE缩减）不足以将 small effect (d_z≈0.3) 推过 Bonferroni\n    门槛 （需 d_z>0.4 在 n=250 时达显著）。s030 的 d_z=0.33 刚好在边缘——n=250 将其 p 值从 0.029 压至 ~0.018，仍然显著。s025\n    (d_z≈0.28) 在 n=250 时 uncorrected p≈0.016 但 Bonferroni×4 后 p≈0.065 仍不显著。关键：这不是\n    power 问题——效应本身就小，LLaMA 架构上 strategy×phase 交互 弱是 true effect。Random phase gradient\n    (d_z 0.33-0.44) CIs 将全部排除零（n=250 时 d_z>0.2 即可），确认 LLaMA 上 random 也有 non-trivial\n    phase gradient——这是与 DeepSeek/Qwen 的关键架构差异。整体结论：within-importance phase gradient\n    强且稳健(d_z~1.0)， imp_vs_rand 交互弱但方向正确(monotonic increasing)，定性结论与 n=50 完全一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - n=50_value\n    - n=250_predicted\n    - change\n    rows:\n    - - imp_vs_rand_dz_s030\n      - '0.3352'\n      - '0.33'\n      - stable (CI narrower)\n    - - Bonferroni_sig_count\n      - 1/4\n      - 1/4\n      - no change\n    - - random_phase_dz_mean\n      - '0.40'\n      - '0.39'\n      - stable\n    - - importance_phase_dz_mean\n      - '1.06'\n      - '1.02'\n      - stable\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Forest plot showing imp_vs_rand d_z with 95% CI for s015-s030, n=50 vs n=250\n    overlay. Both show same pattern—CIs narrow but effect remains small.'\n  - 'Fig: Phase gradient d_z comparison (importance vs random) across 4 sparsity levels,\n    demonstrating LLaMA''s unique pattern where random also shows significant gradient.'\n  analysis: 'n=250 确认 C8 partially_confirmed 不变。论文写法：''At n=250, LLaMA replicates\n    the within-importance phase gradient (d_z≈1.0, all levels p<0.001) but the strategy×phase\n    interaction remains small (d_z 0.18-0.33) with only s030 reaching Bonferroni significance\n    (p=0.018). Critically, random masking on LLaMA shows a non-trivial phase gradient\n    (d_z 0.33-0.44, all CIs exclude zero), suggesting strategy-dependence of compound\n    severity is architecture-modulated.'' 这是 median 档核心论点：phase gradient universal，\n    strategy specificity architecture-dependent。\n\n    '\n- name: c8_llama_gpu0_s025_preemptive\n  plan_id: c8_llama_gpu0_s025\n  description: LLaMA importance s025 单条件预加速（n=250），作为 c8_llama_n250_fixed 的一部分\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 250\n    n_valid: 245\n    importance_s025_median_ii_low: 1.82\n    importance_s025_median_ii_high: 0.085\n    importance_s025_median_diff: 0.088\n    importance_s025_phase_gradient_dz: 1.08\n    importance_s025_phase_gradient_ci:\n    - 0.82\n    - 1.38\n    importance_s025_wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n  result_rationale: '这是 c8_llama_n250_fixed 中的一个子条件。LLaMA importance s025 在 n=50 时\n    phase gradient d_z=1.1227 (CI [0.87, 1.58])。n=250 时 CI 缩窄至 [0.82, 1.38]，中心估计稳定在~1.08。\n    这是 within-importance 效应（不涉及 imp_vs_rand 比较），本身是 large effect，n=250 只是 增加精度。Median\n    II 值与 n=50 的 median_diff=0.0947 基本一致（大样本回归到更稳定估计）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 预期完全符合 n=50 结论，仅 CI 缩窄。不改变任何 claim。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n  description: GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DeepSeek-R1 × importance × s015, quantile三分相位\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    n_valid: 185\n    mid_null_rate: 0.15\n    importance_s015_median_ii_low: 0.28\n    importance_s015_median_ii_mid: 0.09\n    importance_s015_median_ii_high: 0.018\n    importance_s015_median_diff: 0.24\n    importance_s015_ci:\n    - 0.12\n    - 0.42\n    importance_s015_wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n    phase_gradient_dz: 0.52\n    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond 是非数学推理任务（科学 QA），推理链比 MATH-500 短~40%，phase 结构不如数学\n    清晰。s015 是最低 sparsity——在 MATH-500 上 DS imp s015 median_diff=0.39，但 GPQA 推理链 更短意味着\n    low-sparsity phase 的 token 数更少、II 累积效应弱化。预期 median_diff ~0.24 （约为 MATH-500 的 60%），但仍显著（n=198\n    提供充足功效）。Phase gradient monotonic 但 magnitude 衰减：与 GSM8K 模式一致——更简单/更短的推理链 → phase\n    modulation 效应变弱。 这支持 median 档的 cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count:\n    2-3 预测。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-benchmark s015 comparison'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - DS_imp_s015_median_diff\n    - reasoning_chain_length\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - '0.39'\n      - long (avg ~550 tokens)\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '0.241'\n      - medium (avg ~300 tokens)\n    - - GPQA Diamond\n      - 0.24 (predicted)\n      - medium-short (avg ~350 tokens)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart comparing phase gradient magnitude at s015 across three benchmarks,\n    showing consistent monotonic decrease with reasoning chain complexity.'\n  analysis: 'GPQA s015 单条件预期 PASS——phase gradient 存在且显著。但 magnitude 低于 MATH-500， 与\n    median 档预期一致。关键意义：证明 phase modulation 不限于数学推理，也存在于科学 QA， 但 specificity ratio 可能更低（需要完整\n    random 对照才能计算）。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_full_pipeline\n  plan_id: gpqa_diamond_full\n  description: GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DS+QW × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(×2\n    controls s025/s030) = 10 runs\n  expected_results:\n    ds_importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.24\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.68\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 1.85\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 3.92\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    qw_importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.04\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.19\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.72\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 1.68\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    ds_random:\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.58\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.03\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 1.21\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n    qw_random:\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.31\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.06\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.72\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n    imp_rand_ratio:\n      ds_s025: 3.2\n      ds_s030: 3.2\n      qw_s025: 2.3\n      qw_s030: 2.3\n    dose_response_monotonic_ds: true\n    dose_response_monotonic_qw: true\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 2.3-3.2×\n    cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心预测：strategy_specificity_ratio_new_benchmark = [2.0,\n    4.9]。GPQA 作为 非数学推理 benchmark：(1) 推理链更短→ phase 区分度降低→ phase gradient magnitude\n    约为 MATH-500 的 55-65%（类似 GSM8K 衰减模式）；(2) Random eviction 在 GPQA 上也会显示 更强的 phase\n    gradient（因为任务推理结构不如数学严格，attention 模式更分散）， 导致 imp/rand ratio 从 MATH-500 的 15× 衰减至\n    2-4×；(3) 两模型 importance gradient 均 monotonic（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count\n    达到 3/3）——phase gradient 的 universality 是 median 档确认的核心结论；(4) QW imp s015 可能 borderline\n    （p=0.02 uncorrected，Bonferroni 后 NS），与 QW onset threshold s≥0.20 一致。 DS random\n    s025 预期 borderline 显著——GPQA 的 random 比 MATH-500 更容易显著，因为 任务本身 phase structure\n    更弱→ random 和 importance 的差异缩小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy specificity ratio across benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - DS_ratio_s025\n    - DS_ratio_s030\n    - QW_ratio_s025\n    - QW_ratio_s030\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500 (n=500)\n      - 15.5×\n      - 16.6×\n      - 2.7×\n      - 3.5×\n    - - GSM8K (n=50)\n      - 3.8×\n      - 2.8×\n      - ~3×\n      - ~2.5×\n    - - GPQA Diamond (n=198, predicted)\n      - 3.2×\n      - 3.2×\n      - 2.3×\n      - 2.3×\n  - name: 'Table: Dose-response comparison (DS importance median_gradient)'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500\n    - GSM8K\n    - GPQA (predicted)\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.241'\n      - '0.24'\n    - - s020\n      - '1.21'\n      - '0.740'\n      - '0.68'\n    - - s025\n      - '3.99'\n      - '1.992'\n      - '1.85'\n    - - s030\n      - '8.48'\n      - '4.682'\n      - '3.92'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three-panel dose-response curves (MATH-500 / GSM8K / GPQA) showing parallel\n    monotonic gradients with benchmark-dependent magnitude scaling.'\n  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × sparsity × model) demonstrating\n    systematic attenuation from MATH-500 (15×) → GSM8K (3×) → GPQA (3×).'\n  analysis: 'GPQA 完整数据将强化 C10 的叙事方向：phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健（3/3 monotonic），\n    但 strategy specificity 高度 task-dependent（15× → 3× → 3×）。论文 Discussion 需要 一段专门解释\n    specificity 衰减的可能机制：更短的推理链 → phase boundary 更模糊 → random eviction 在\"错误\" phase\n    的概率上升 → imp/rand 区分缩小。这是 median 档要求 的 \"softened language\" 之一：不能说 \"strategy specificity\n    is a universal property\"， 必须限定为 \"strongest on complex mathematical reasoning with\n    long CoT\"。\n\n    '\n- name: qwen25_14b_math500\n  plan_id: 14b_scale_extension\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(s030)\n    = 5 runs\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_diff: 0.055\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n        cohens_d: 0.42\n      s020:\n        median_diff: 0.28\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n        cohens_d: 0.68\n      s025:\n        median_diff: 0.92\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        cohens_d: 1.05\n      s030:\n        median_diff: 2.35\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        cohens_d: 1.28\n    random_s030:\n      median_diff: 0.68\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n      phase_gradient_dz: 0.38\n    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 3.5\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n      s015: 0.85\n      s020: 0.92\n      s025: 1.02\n      s030: 0.95\n    onset_threshold: s015 (similar to QW-7B)\n  result_rationale: '14B 模型相对 7B 有更多 attention heads (40→40 for 14B GQA, 但 KV heads\n    从 8→8)， 实际 GQA 结构意味着 head pruning 的冗余度不同。预期：(1) Phase gradient 依然 monotonic 且\n    d_z~1.0（与 Qwen2-7B 一致，因为 phase modulation 是 reasoning structure 的属性， 不强依赖模型规模）；(2)\n    Absolute magnitude 可能比 7B 略小（14B 更鲁棒，residual stream 容量更大）——median_diff ~2.35\n    vs 7B 的 3.16 at s030；(3) Strategy specificity ratio ~3.5×（14B random 也更难产生大 gradient，因为冗余更多）；(4)\n    Onset threshold 仍在 s015 （与 7B Qwen 一致，架构决定而非规模决定）。Median 档预期：这个实验不会 dramatically\n    改变 故事，但为 Limitations 中的 \"7B only\" 提供部分回应。Cohen''s d 范围 0.42→1.28 落在 qw_cohens_d_range\n    [0.37, 1.44] 内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 14B vs 7B Qwen importance dose-response'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - QW-7B_median_diff (n=500)\n    - QW-14B_predicted (n=50)\n    - ratio\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - '0.066'\n      - '0.055'\n      - 0.83×\n    - - s020\n      - '0.307'\n      - '0.28'\n      - 0.91×\n    - - s025\n      - '1.075'\n      - '0.92'\n      - 0.86×\n    - - s030\n      - '3.155'\n      - '2.35'\n      - 0.74×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dual dose-response curve (7B vs 14B) with shared x-axis (sparsity) showing\n    parallel scaling with 14B ~20-25% lower magnitude.'\n  analysis: '14B 实验是 reviewer concern RC1 (7B only) 的直接回应。Median 档预期：定性完全复制 （monotonic,\n    strategy×phase interaction），定量略弱（magnitude ~75-90% of 7B）。 论文加一句：\"Preliminary\n    results on Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct (n=50) replicate the monotonic phase gradient\n    (Spearman ρ=1.0, all d_z>0.8), suggesting the phenomenon is not scale-specific\n    within the 7-14B range. Larger-scale validation remains future work.\" 这足够回应 reviewer\n    而不需要 14B 的完整 n=500 replication。\n\n    '\n- name: c10_lang_s020_s025_analysis\n  plan_id: c10_lang_s020_s025\n  description: MATH-500 language switching at s020/s025, 补全 dense→s015→s020→s025→s030\n    全链\n  expected_results:\n    s020:\n      switch_rate: 0.14\n      cn_count: 7\n      en_count: 43\n      cn_acc: 0.33\n      en_acc: 0.25\n    s025:\n      switch_rate: 0.32\n      cn_count: 16\n      en_count: 34\n      cn_acc: 0.2\n      en_acc: 0.057\n    full_chain_switch_rate:\n    - 0.0\n    - 0.04\n    - 0.14\n    - 0.32\n    - 0.4\n    monotonic: true\n    correlation_switch_vs_ii: 0.55\n  result_rationale: '这个实验已经完成（registry 显示 success）。实际结果与 median 档吻合：language switching\n    单调递增 (0%→4%→14%→32%→40%)，是 compound degradation 的 behavioral manifestation。 Switch\n    rate 与 II 相关但不完美(r≈0.55)——因为 switching 是离散二元事件而 II 是连续量， 且 switching 受模型 tokenizer\n    双语 capability 影响（architecture-specific confound）。 Median 档解读：这个数据支持论文的 Discussion\n    段落（compound sparsity 不仅影响数值推理 能力，还影响 language coherence），但不能作为独立 claim——它是 severity\n    的 symptom 而非 独立发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Language switching dose-response'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - switch_rate\n    - cn_acc\n    - en_acc\n    - overall_acc\n    rows:\n    - - dense\n      - 0%\n      - N/A\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.52'\n    - - s015\n      - 4%\n      - 0%\n      - '0.375'\n      - '0.36'\n    - - s020\n      - 14%\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.26'\n    - - s025\n      - 32%\n      - '0.20'\n      - '0.057'\n      - '0.10'\n    - - s030\n      - 40%\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.10'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dual-axis plot—left axis: accuracy decline; right axis: Chinese switching\n    rate. Both monotonic, showing compound sparsity triggers multilingual collapse.'\n  analysis: 'Language switching 数据已完成，为 Appendix 提供额外 behavioral evidence。 不改变核心 claims。Median\n    档下，这属于 ''nice-to-have supplementary evidence'' 而非 论文主线。§6 Discussion 加一段提及即可。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_think_validation\n  plan_id: gpqa_think_validation\n  description: GPQA Diamond </think> phase segmentation validation (Run 2, supplementary)\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    n_valid: 180\n    median_kappa: 0.82\n    thinking_in_low_sparsity_phase: 0.72\n    answer_in_high_sparsity_phase: 0.58\n    temporal_ordering: 0.51\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA 的 </think> validation 预期 kappa 略低于 MATH-500 (0.88)——GPQA\n    是多选题， 推理链结构更不规则（有些问题直接选答案，有些有长推理）。Kappa=0.82 仍在 ''substantial agreement'' 范围。thinking_in_low=0.72（低于\n    MATH-500 的 0.82）因为 GPQA 推理链更短 导致 low-sparsity phase 混合了更多 transition 内容。Answer_in_high=0.58（低于\n    MATH-500 的 0.66）因为 GPQA 答案部分通常只有一个字母选项，token 数极少，phase assignment 更不稳定。Temporal\n    ordering 更低（0.51 vs 0.58）因为 GPQA 非线性推理 较多（排除法、回溯等）。这些都是 median 档预期——kappa 仍然 acceptable\n    但 phase alignment 指标比数学弱。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Appendix figure showing kappa distribution across GPQA problems (histogram)\n    vs MATH-500 overlay.'\n  analysis: Supplementary validation，放 Appendix。如果 kappa<0.75 则需要承认 quantile  segmentation\n    在 GPQA 上不如 MATH-500 可靠——但 0.82 仍然足够支持主结论。 不影响论文主线 claims。\n","numLines":487,"startLine":1,"totalLines":487}}}
